---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/seo/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { BRAND_NAME, BRAND_EMAIL, SITE_NAME } from '../lib/seo/site';
import { PLANS } from '../lib/plans';

const FREE = PLANS.find((p) => p.id === 'free')!;
const PRO = PLANS.find((p) => p.id === 'pro')!;
const LAST_UPDATED = '1 August 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description={`The terms that apply when you use ${SITE_NAME}.`}
  path="/terms"
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ name: 'Terms', path: '/terms' }]} />

  <section class="px-6 pt-10 pb-20 sm:pt-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl dark:text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate">Last updated: {LAST_UPDATED}</p>

      <div class="glass mt-10 space-y-8 rounded-[28px] p-7 leading-relaxed text-slate sm:p-10">
        <p>
          These terms apply when you use {SITE_NAME} ("Growth Audit"), operated by {BRAND_NAME}, at{' '}
          <strong class="font-semibold text-ink dark:text-white">app.dean-da-dev.co.uk</strong>. By running an audit,
          creating an account, or subscribing to Pro, you agree to these terms.
        </p>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">1. The service</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Growth Audit scans a website you provide and reports on SEO, performance, accessibility, conversion and local
            SEO signals it detects, then offers recommendations. You can run a one-off audit with no account, or create a
            free account to save a website and monitor it automatically over time.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">2. Plans</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            <strong class="font-semibold text-ink dark:text-white">Free ({FREE.price})</strong> includes {FREE.websiteLimit}{' '}
            monitored website, weekly scans, website health tracking and push notifications.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            <strong class="font-semibold text-ink dark:text-white">Pro ({PRO.price})</strong> includes up to {PRO.websiteLimit}{' '}
            monitored websites, daily scans, competitor monitoring, AI Coach and weekly AI reports.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Pro subscriptions are billed monthly via Stripe and renew automatically until cancelled. You can cancel at any
            time from your account billing settings; your Pro access continues until the end of the current billing period,
            with no partial refund for the remaining days. We don't offer refunds for partial months, except where required
            by law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">3. Your account</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            You're responsible for keeping your login credentials secure and for all activity under your account. You must
            provide accurate information and only add websites you own or are authorised to audit and monitor.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">4. Acceptable use</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">You agree not to:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
            <li>Use the service to scan websites you don't own or don't have permission to audit.</li>
            <li>Attempt to bypass plan limits, rate limits or other technical restrictions.</li>
            <li>Use the service to build a competing product, or resell access to it.</li>
            <li>Use the service in any way that's unlawful, abusive or disrupts it for other users.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">5. Accuracy of results</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Audit results, scores and AI Coach guidance are generated automatically and are provided as a starting point for
            improving your website — not as a guarantee of any outcome (such as improved rankings, traffic or enquiries).
            You're responsible for reviewing and validating any recommendation before acting on it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">6. Availability</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We aim to keep Growth Audit available and monitoring running on schedule, but we don't guarantee uninterrupted
            service, and scheduled scans may occasionally be delayed (for example during maintenance or a third-party
            outage).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">7. Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Growth Audit is provided "as is". To the fullest extent permitted by law, {BRAND_NAME} is not liable for any
            indirect, incidental or consequential loss arising from your use of the service, including decisions made based
            on audit results or AI Coach guidance.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">8. Termination</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            You can delete your account at any time. We may suspend or terminate accounts that breach these terms, misuse
            the service, or where we're required to for legal reasons.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">9. Changes to these terms</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We may update these terms from time to time. If we make material changes, we'll update the date at the top of
            this page. Continued use of Growth Audit after a change means you accept the updated terms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">10. Governing law</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-white">11. Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Questions about these terms can be sent to
            <a href={`mailto:${BRAND_EMAIL}`} class="font-semibold text-brand-500 hover:underline">{BRAND_EMAIL}</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
